  {
   "id": "a-building-full-of-cats-199237@major-2022-07-19",
   "gameId": "a-building-full-of-cats-199237",
   "displayName": "Update and News",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2022-07-19T14:14:04.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "UPDATE",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Traditional Chinese is now available in the game",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Corrected some typos",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed minor visual glitches",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "What's next?",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "• More Languages",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We already hired Polish and Turkish translators, not just for this game but also for our upcoming games.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• Hint system",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We are working on a hint system.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "These new updates are coming in the following weeks.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "The future...",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "We have received several requests for a DLC or sequel. We already have something very cute in mind, but with a little twist...",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "\"A Castle Full of Cats\" is a hidden object game with a metroidvania structure, so... this is a catvania!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fofiño was cursed by an evil force and transformed every cat in the castle into a dark (yet cute) creature.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Now only Lily can save her soulmate and release the castle from the spell!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fear not, our dear humans: this castle is still going to be heartwarming and surely put a smile on your face! ♥ (Hopefully!)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "It's going to be a bigger game, with several rooms and many alternate paths. Check out the page for more info!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "\"A Castle Full of Cats\" is coming on October 28, to celebrate Halloween!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "That's all for today. See you again, soon!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Love & Purrs,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Devcats ฅ^•ﻌ•^ฅ",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
